      {
       "w": 507,
       "h": 163,
       "kind": "text",
       "tag": "p",
       "text": "A grim mountaintop town once shared its magical life-giving river with the valley below—until the nobles sealed the gates and kept the power for themselves. The valley died. Now a lone warrior is sent on a deadly mission: climb the forbidden mountain, infiltrate the corrupted town, kill the tyrant who controls the river, and bring back his head.",
       "font": {
        "f": "dm",
