       "tag": "p",
       "text": "_I built several core gameplay systems in Blueprint, starting with a Souls-like player controller featuring slow, grounded movement with no jump. I also created three types of enemy AI: a basic enemy, a mini-boss, and a main boss. Additional systems include a health-potion healing mechanic, multiple weapon pickups, and a functional campfire that acts as both a save point and a respawn location._",
